CloudBurrow patch 94 to github.com/goccy/bigquery-emulator v0.8.1
(cloudburrow/cloudburrow#1783). Applies after patch 0086; needs
googlesqlite patch 0093.

tabledata.insertAll (and a load) into a REPEATED JSON column bound the
array through PARSE_JSON(?), the top-level JSON column's placeholder,
which the engine refuses ("Value has type JSON which cannot be inserted
into column aj, which has type ARRAY<JSON>"), so every such insert failed
500. A REPEATED JSON column is bound as an array of each element's JSON
text, which the engine reads as JSON (googlesqlite patch 0093). The test
also holds a RECORD's JSON field and an ARRAY<STRUCT<JSON>>'s, which 0093
fixes, through the official client's insertAll: JSON_VALUE of them reads
the JSON. struct_json_field_test.go fails without the two patches and
passes with them.

